      "gpio_input": {
        "basis": "GPIO port levels the X-T4 2.12 loader sampled at a power-on of a running X-T4 (boot-information words 0x00..0x3c of its kernel copy in RAM), taken with the service-entry keys held. Port 0 bits 0 and 1 (shutter S1/S2, active low as on the X-T3) are declared released. The firmware selects the firmware-update start from these levels (DISP/BACK held at power-on); all-zero levels read every active-low key as held and start it. The service-entry UP key is not located and may still read held.",
